 \"a6a23450-f444-5f2f-a684-aa998f8e2f64\"] [\"a6a23450-f444-5f2f-a684-aa998f8e2f64\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"a6a23450-f444-5f2f-a684-aa998f8e2f64\" :answer/value \"-2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"724fe2c8-bd5c-52c8-822c-2f560bfc0df9\" :answer/id #uuid \"724fe2c8-bd5c-52c8-822c-2f560bfc0df9\"] [\"724fe2c8-bd5c-52c8-822c-2f560bfc0df9\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"724fe2c8-bd5c-52c8-822c-2f560bfc0df9\" :answer/value \"-\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"87d0fe98-793f-5c5c-ae8f-50ede75bb5b7\" :answer/id #uuid \"87d0fe98-793f-5c5c-ae8f-50ede75bb5b7\"] [\"87d0fe98-793f-5c5c-ae8f-50ede75bb5b7\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"87d0fe98-793f-5c5c-ae8f-50ede75bb5b7\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"20a6f83e-08a7-5e18-b0a6-e42e13f4d6b1\" :answer/id #uuid \"20a6f83e-08a7-5e18-b0a6-e42e13f4d6b1\"] [\"20a6f83e-08a7-5e18-b0a6-e42e13f4d6b1\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"20a6f83e-08a7-5e18-b0a6-e42e13f4d6b1\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"4794dbc9-64ab-5a53-a007-6a1a920a04b4\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"4794dbc9-64ab-5a53-a007-6a1a920a04b4\"] [\"4794dbc9-64ab-5a53-a007-6a1a920a04b4\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"4794dbc9-64ab-5a53-a007-6a1a920a04b4\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"4794dbc9-64ab-5a53-a007-6a1a920a04b4\" :answer-field/choices \"1370ebf1-d10d-5180-8784-1da63b65d3cc\"] [\"4794dbc9-64ab-5a53-a007-6a1a920a04b4\" :answer-field/choices \"a6a23450-f444-5f2f-a684-aa998f8e2f64\"] [\"4794dbc9-64ab-5a53-a007-6a1a920a04b4\" :answer-field/choices \"724fe2c8-bd5c-52c8-822c-2f560bfc0df9\"] [\"4794dbc9-64ab-5a53-a007-6a1a920a04b4\" :answer-field/choices \"87d0fe98-793f-5c5c-ae8f-50ede75bb5b7\"] [\"4794dbc9-64ab-5a53-a007-6a1a920a04b4\" :answer-field/choices \"20a6f83e-08a7-5e18-b0a6-e42e13f4d6b1\"] [\"4794dbc9-64ab-5a53-a007-6a1a920a04b4\" :answer-field/correct \"1370ebf1-d10d-5180-8784-1da63b65d3cc\"] [\"03958827-e800-5038-835b-8f267d750c98\" :question/id #uuid \"03958827-e800-5038-835b-8f267d750c98\"] [\"03958827-e800-5038-835b-8f267d750c98\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=2 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2 \\\\cos{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"03958827-e800-5038-835b-8f267d750c98\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 2 \\\\cos{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\"] [\"03958827-e800-5038-835b-8f267d750c98\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"03958827-e800-5038-835b-8f267d750c98\" :question/answer-fields \"4794dbc9-64ab-5a53-a007-6a1a920a04b4\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"03958827-e800-5038-835b-8f267d750c98\"] [\"7339cd0e-1f29-56db-82c5-65e15ad5bc9b\" :answer/id #uuid \"7339cd0e-1f29-56db-82c5-65e15ad5bc9b\"] [\"7339cd0e-1f29-56db-82c5-65e15ad5bc9b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"7339cd0e-1f29-56db-82c5-65e15ad5bc9b\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\pi}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}} \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"bc570b4c-f861-5bd1-93e0-e9c24129d5bc\" :answer/id #uuid \"bc570b4c-f861-5bd1-93e0-e9c24129d5bc\"] [\"bc570b4c-f861-5bd1-93e0-e9c24129d5bc\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"bc570b4c-f861-5bd1-93e0-e9c24129d5bc\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}} \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"fcf34e2b-5be3-5e2f-a6e9-571fa3eaeb2f\" :answer/id #uuid \"fcf34e2b-5be3-5e2f-a6e9-571f