lem \"Use the substitution $u=3 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}} \\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"77949b95-c0b4-5835-9c69-635a354c01c4\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=3.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\pi\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}} \\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{\\\\pi} \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{\\\\pi} \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"77949b95-c0b4-5835-9c69-635a354c01c4\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"77949b95-c0b4-5835-9c69-635a354c01c4\" :question/answer-fields \"d9e83ee0-4cee-5737-a67c-38a3c93a3e99\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"77949b95-c0b4-5835-9c69-635a354c01c4\"] [\"c717e493-67d1-5bc5-a487-4f2939406ecb\" :answer/id #uuid \"c717e493-67d1-5bc5-a487-4f2939406ecb\"] [\"c717e493-67d1-5bc5-a487-4f2939406ecb\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"c717e493-67d1-5bc5-a487-4f2939406ecb\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}}^{2 \\\\pi} \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"0c353a19-a25f-5078-b6f3-06dfcb6caea6\" :answer/id #uuid \"0c353a19-a25f-5078-b6f3-06dfcb6caea6\"] [\"0c353a19-a25f-5078-b6f3-06dfcb6caea6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"0c353a19-a25f-5078-b6f3-06dfcb6caea6\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{4}}^{\\\\pi} \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"528070fb-b8bd-5441-9140-45ad14d2bb8c\" :answer/id #uuid \"528070fb-b8bd-5441-9140-45ad14d2bb8c\"] [\"528070fb-b8bd-5441-9140-45ad14d2bb8c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"528070fb-b8bd-5441-9140-45ad14d2bb8c\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{2 \\\\pi}^{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}} \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"5fd23677-6da2-5d26-8454-2efaaa0f66da\" :answer/id #uuid \"5fd23677-6da2-5d26-8454-2efaaa0f66da\"] [\"5fd23677-6da2-5d26-8454-2efaaa0f66da\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"5fd23677-6da2-5d26-8454-2efaaa0f66da\" :answer/value \"6\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}}^{2 \\\\pi} \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"87268af2-555b-5869-bd1d-42efcda52e84\" :answer/id #uuid \"87268af2-555b-5869-bd1d-42efcda52e84\"] [\"87268af2-555b-5869-bd1d-42efcda52e84\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"87268af2-555b-5869-bd1d-42efcda52e84\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}}^{2 \\\\pi} \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"6ff1f7d1-ba92-5659-a166-86a70b0b1e04\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"6ff1f7d1-ba92-5659-a166-86a70b0b1e04\"] [\"6ff1f7d1-ba92-5659-a166-86a70b0b1e04\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"6ff1f7d1-ba92-5659-a166-86a70b0b1e04\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"6ff1f7d1-ba92-5659-a166-86a70b0b1e04\" :answer-field/choices \"c717e493-67d1-5bc5-a487-4f2939406ecb\"] [\"6ff1f7d1-ba92-5659-a166-86a70b0b1e04\" :answer-field/choices \"0c353a19-a25f-5078-b6f3-06dfcb6caea6\"] [\"6ff1f7d1-ba92-5659-a166-86a70b0b1e04\" :answer-field/choices \"528070fb-b8bd-5441-9140-45ad14d2bb8c\"] [\"6ff1f7d1-ba92-5659-a166-86a70b0b1e04\" :answer-field/choices \"5fd23677-6da2-5d26-8454-2efaaa0f66da\"] [\"6ff1f7d1-ba92-5659-a166-86a70b0b1e04\" :answer-field/choices \"87268af2-555b-5869-bd1d-42efcda52e84\"] [\"6ff1f7d1-ba92-5659-a166-86a70b0b1e04\" :answer-field/correct \"87268af2-555b-5869-bd1d-42efcda52e84\"] [\"7f76f030-ea03-524c-9680-a6f688f6325f\" :question/id #uuid \"7f76f030-ea03-524c-9680-a6f688f6325f\"] [\"7f76f030-ea03-524c-9680-a6f688f6325f\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=2 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{4}}^{\\\\pi} 3 \\\\sin{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"7f76f030-ea03-524c-9680-a6f688f6325f\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{4}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}\\\\\\\\x=\\\\pi&\\\\Longrightarrow u=2 \\\\pi\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{4}}^{\\\\pi} 3 \\\\sin{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}}^{2 \\\\pi} \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}}^{2 \\\\pi} \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"7f76f030-ea03-524c-9680-a6f688f6325f\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"7f76f030-ea03-524c-9680-a6f688f6325f\" :question/answer-fields \"6ff1f7d1-ba92-5659-a166-86a70b0b1e04\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"7f76f030-ea03-524c-9680-a6f688f6325f\"] [\"af66ef88-cf83-5f91-bfc0-f9f6fb513226\" :answer/id #uuid \"af66ef88-cf83-5f91-bfc0-f9f6fb513226\"] [\"af66ef88-cf83-5f91-bfc0-f9f6fb513226\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"af66ef88-cf83-5f91-bfc0-f9f6fb513226\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{8}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"4f51384d-7893-5c2f-b40e-f039060605dc\" :answer/id #uuid \"4f51384d-7893-5c2f-b40e-f039060605dc\"] [\"4f51384d-7893-5c2f-b40e-f039060605dc\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"4f51384d-7893-5c2f-b40e-f039060605dc\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"6b56642e-85d1-54a2-9e38-06e33e664536\" :answer/id #uuid \"6b56642e-85d1-54a2-9e38-06e33e664536\"] [\"6b56642e-85d1-54a2-9e38-06e33e664536\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"6b56642e-85d1-54a2-9e38-06e33e664536\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"bdbd2481-d186-5643-8429-a445812bd2dc\" :answer/id #uuid \"bdbd2481-d186-5643-8429-a445812bd2dc\"] [\"bdbd2481-d186-5643-8429-a445812bd2dc\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"bdbd2481-d186-5643-8429-a445812bd2dc\" :answer/value \"8\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"3185c284-174a-5de9-9fcc-b81120e57947\" :answer/id #uuid \"3185c284-174a-5de9-9fcc-b81120e57947\"] [\"3185c284-174a-5de9-9fcc-b81120e57947\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"3185c284-174a-5de9-9fcc-b81120e57947\" :answer/value \"-\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"a3508ac1-91cd-5909-b864-c38a56b47702\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"a3508ac1-91cd-5909-b864-c38a56b47702\"] [\"a3508ac1-91cd-5909-b864-c38a56b47702\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"a3508ac1-91cd-5909-b864-c38a56b47702\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"a3508ac1-91cd-5909-b864-c38a56b47702\" :answer-field/choices \"af66ef88-cf83-5f91-bfc0-f9f6fb513226\"] [\"a3508ac1-91cd-5909-b864-c38a56b47702\" :answer-field/choices \"4f51384d-7893-5c2f-b40e-f039060605dc\"] [\"a3508ac1-91cd-5909-b864-c38a56b47702\" :answer-field/choices \"6b56642e-85d1-54a2-9e38-06e33e664536\"] [\"a3508ac1-91cd-5909-b864-c38a56b47702\" :answer-field/choices \"bdbd2481-d186-5643-8429-a445812bd2dc\"] [\"a3508ac1-91cd-5909-b864-c38a56b47702\" :answer-field/choices \"3185c284-174a-5de9-9fcc-b81120e57947\"] [\"a3508ac1-91cd-5909-b864-c38a56b47702\" :answer-field/correct \"4f51384d-7893-5c2f-b40e-f039060605dc\"] [\"369e69ee-ba29-5731-a1df-5057b2bd69bb\" :question/id #uuid \"369e69ee-ba29-5731-a1df-5057b2bd69bb\"] [\"369e69ee-ba29-5731-a1df-5057b2bd69bb\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=4 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2 \\\\sin{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"369e69ee-ba29-5731-a1df-5057b2bd69bb\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=4.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 2 \\\\sin{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"369e69ee-ba29-5731-a1df-5057b2bd69bb\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"369e69ee-ba29-5731-a1df-5057b2bd69bb\" :question/answer-fields \"a3508ac1-91cd-5909-b864-c38a56b47702\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"369e69ee-ba29-5731-a1df-5057b2bd69bb\"] [\"a73c7853-e031-54b0-8d07-0814d416a36c\" :answer/id #uuid \"a73c7853-e031-54b0-8d07-0814d416a36c\"] [\"a73c7853-e031-54b0-8d07-0814d416a36c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"a73c7853-e031-54b0-8d07-0814d416a36c\" :answer/value \"-\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"78d2fabd-5621-5dc4-895e-1542b704d140\" :answer/id #uuid \"78d2fabd-5621-5dc4-895e-1542b704d140\"] [\"78d2fabd-5621-5dc4-895e-1542b704d140\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"78d2fabd-5621-5dc4-895e-1542b704d140\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"d6516896-aae3-5b1a-8668-b8e47e7400b4\" :answer/id #uuid \"d6516896-aae3-5b1a-8668-b8e47e7400b4\"] [\"d6516896-aae3-5b1a-8668-b8e47e7400b4\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"d6516896-aae3-5b1a-8668-b8e47e7400b4\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"a1815eda-ab58-58e7-8b74-3c36e64843de\" :answer/id #uuid \"a1815eda-ab58-58e7-8b74-3c36e64843de\"] [\"a1815eda-ab58-58e7-8b74-3c36e64843de\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"a1815eda-ab58-58e7-8b74-3c36e64843de\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"c902d9fa-5024-5388-801d-133c06ec4daf\" :answer/id #uuid \"c902d9fa-5024-5388-801d-133c06ec4daf\"] [\"c902d9fa-5024-5388-801d-133c06ec4daf\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"c902d9fa-5024-5388-801d-133c06ec4daf\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"ec2ea545-7705-5b75-bfb2-a127dac9549b\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"ec2ea545-7705-5b75-bfb2-a127dac9549b\"] [\"ec2ea545-7705-5b75-bfb2-a127dac9549b\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"ec2ea545-7705-5b75-bfb2-a127dac9549b\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"ec2ea545-7705-5b75-bfb2-a127dac9549b\" :answer-field/choices \"a73c7853-e031-54b0-8d07-0814d416a36c\"] [\"ec2ea545-7705-5b75-bfb2-a127dac9549b\" :answer-field/choices \"78d2fabd-5621-5dc4-895e-1542b704d140\"] [\"ec2ea545-7705-5b75-bfb2-a127dac9549b\" :answer-field/choices \"d6516896-aae3-5b1a-8668-b8e47e7400b4\"] [\"ec2ea545-7705-5b75-bfb2-a127dac9549b\" :answer-field/choices \"a1815eda-ab58-58e7-8b74-3c36e64843de\"] [\"ec2ea545-7705-5b75-bfb2-a127dac9549b\" :answer-field/choices \"c902d9fa-5024-5388-801d-133c06ec4daf\"] [\"ec2ea545-7705-5b75-bfb2-a127dac9549b\" :answer-field/correct \"78d2fabd-5621-5dc4-895e-1542b704d140\"] [\"e96a768a-8b82-51b7-a945-24730214a8a0\" :question/id #uuid \"e96a768a-8b82-51b7-a945-24730214a8a0\"] [\"e96a768a-8b82-51b7-a945-24730214a8a0\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=3 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"e96a768a-8b82-51b7-a945-24730214a8a0\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=3.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"e96a768a-8b82-51b7-a945-24730214a8a0\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"e96a768a-8b82-51b7-a945-24730214a8a0\" :question/answer-fields \"ec2ea545-7705-5b75-bfb2-a127dac9549b\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"e96a768a-8b82-51b7-a945-24730214a8a0\"] [\"dd974687-5fe3-5eb5-b3e7-f18717cb0939\" :answer/id #uuid \"dd974687-5fe3-5eb5-b3e7-f18717cb0939\"] [\"dd974687-5fe3-5eb5-b3e7-f18717cb0939\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"dd974687-5fe3-5eb5-b3e7-f18717cb0939\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(4 x + 3 \\\\right)}}{4}\"] [\"0c6c0ae1-37a9-54de-9f9b-77c31a7073fb\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"0c6c0ae1-37a9-54de-9f9b-77c31a7073fb\"] [\"0c6c0ae1-37a9-54de-9f9b-77c31a7073fb\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"0c6c0ae1-37a9-54de-9f9b-77c31a7073fb\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"0c6c0ae1-37a9-54de-9f9b-77c31a7073fb\" :answer-field/choices \"dd974687-5fe3-5eb5-b3e7-f18717cb0939\"] [\"0c6c0ae1-37a9-54de-9f9b-77c31a7073fb\" :answer-field/correct \"dd974687-5fe3-5eb5-b3e7-f18717cb0939\"] [\"85d13d2d-f042-57af-a1a0-8e6f471f6d8a\" :question/id #uuid \"85d13d2d-f042-57af-a1a0-8e6f471f6d8a\"] [\"85d13d2d-f042-57af-a1a0-8e6f471f6d8a\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(4 x + 3 \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"85d13d2d-f042-57af-a1a0-8e6f471f6d8a\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x + 3$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=4.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(4 x + 3 \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=- \\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{4}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(4 x + 3 \\\\right)}}{4}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"85d13d2d-f042-57af-a1a0-8e6f471f6d8a\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"85d13d2d-f042-57af-a1a0-8e6f471f6d8a\" :question/answer-fields \"0c6c0ae1-37a9-54de-9f9b-77c31a7073fb\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"85d13d2d-f042-57af-a1a0-8e6f471f6d8a\"] [\"5871b02d-2bef-5fb1-865e-65aff4cc3969\" :answer/id #uuid \"5871b02d-2bef-5fb1-865e-65aff4cc3969\"] [\"5871b02d-2bef-5fb1-865e-65aff4cc3969\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"5871b02d-2bef-5fb1-865e-65aff4cc3969\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{4}\"] [\"866f3cb3-d08c-55fc-9741-2055767f7e3a\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"866f3cb3-d08c-55fc-9741-2055767f7e3a\"] [\"866f3cb3-d08c-55fc-9741-2055767f7e3a\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"866f3cb3-d08c-55fc-9741-2055767f7e3a\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"866f3cb3-d08c-55fc-9741-2055767f7e3a\" :answer-field/choices \"5871b02d-2bef-5fb1-865e-65aff4cc3969\"] [\"866f3cb3-d08c-55fc-9741-2055767f7e3a\" :answer-field/correct \"5871b02d-2bef-5fb1-865e-65aff4cc3969\"] [\"e448a4d2-65fb-5da5-83af-e67ab30b203d\" :question/id #uuid \"e448a4d2-65fb-5da5-83af-e67ab30b203d\"] [\"e448a4d2-65fb-5da5-83af-e67ab30b203d\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{8}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}} 3 \\\\cos{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\sin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}=-1,\\\\quad \\\\sin{\\\\left(2 \\\\pi \\\\right)}=0$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"e448a4d2-65fb-5da5-83af-e67ab30b203d\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=4.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{8}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=2 \\\\pi\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{8}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}} 3 \\\\cos{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}}^{2 \\\\pi} \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[\\\\frac{3 \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{4}\\\\right]_{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}}^{2 \\\\pi}=\\\\left(0\\\\right)-\\\\left(- \\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{4}.\\n$$\"] [\"e448a4d2-65fb-5da5-83af-e67ab30b203d\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"e448a4d2-65fb-5da5-83af-e67ab30b203d\" :question/answer-fields \"866f3cb3-d08c-55fc-9741-2055767f7e3a\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"e448a4d2-65fb-5da5-83af-e67ab30b203d\"] [\"21ace9e0-6bda-5c7f-ac52-9b7bae7dcbe3\" :answer/id #uuid \"21ace9e0-6bda-5c7f-ac52-9b7bae7dcbe3\"] [\"21ace9e0-6bda-5c7f-ac52-9b7bae7dcbe3\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"21ace9e0-6bda-5c7f-ac52-9b7bae7dcbe3\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{2}\"] [\"cc9a28eb-7848-5087-9875-b8382c66378c\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"cc9a28eb-7848-5087-9875-b8382c66378c\"] [\"cc9a28eb-7848-5087-9875-b8382c66378c\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"cc9a28eb-7848-5087-9875-b8382c66378c\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"cc9a28eb-7848-5087-9875-b8382c66378c\" :answer-field/choices \"21ace9e0-6bda-5c7f-ac52-9b7bae7dcbe3\"] [\"cc9a28eb-7848-5087-9875-b8382c66378c\" :answer-field/correct \"21ace9e0-6bda-5c7f-ac52-9b7bae7dcbe3\"] [\"f85dd1a8-9614-5c1d-8fde-7f1192c68aed\" :question/id #uuid \"f85dd1a8-9614-5c1d-8fde-7f1192c68aed\"] [\"f85dd1a8-9614-5c1d-8fde-7f1192c68aed\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}} 3 \\\\sin{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\cos{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\cos{\\\\left(\\\\pi \\\\right)}=-1$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"f85dd1a8-9614-5c1d-8fde-7f1192c68aed\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\pi\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}} 3 \\\\sin{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{\\\\pi} \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[- \\\\frac{3 \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{2}\\\\right]_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{\\\\pi}=\\\\left(\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{2}.\\n$$\"] [\"f85dd1a8-9614-5c1d-8fde-7f1192c68aed\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"f85dd1a8-9614-5c1d-8fde-7f1192c68aed\" :question/answer-fields \"cc9a28eb-7848-5087-9875-b8382c66378c\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"f85dd1a8-9614-5c1d-8fde-7f1192c68aed\"] [\"06e86e62-b46c-53c0-b647-0a53dd840de6\" :answer/id #uuid \"06e86e62-b46c-53c0-b647-0a53dd840de6\"] [\"06e86e62-b46c-53c0-b647-0a53dd840de6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"06e86e62-b46c-53c0-b647-0a53dd840de6\" :answer/value \"\\\\sin{\\\\left(4 x + 1 \\\\right)}\"] [\"58cda100-a260-5e8e-be68-fde68d9e9f1e\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"58cda100-a260-5e8e-be68-fde68d9e9f1e\"] [\"58cda100-a260-5e8e-be68-fde68d9e9f1e\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"58cda100-a260-5e8e-be68-fde68d9e9f1e\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"58cda100-a260-5e8e-be68-fde68d9e9f1e\" :answer-field/choices \"06e86e62-b46c-53c0-b647-0a53dd840de6\"] [\"58cda100-a260-5e8e-be68-fde68d9e9f1e\" :answer-field/correct \"06e86e62-b46c-53c0-b647-0a53dd840de6\"] [\"2ecdfaa1-5bd9-5f81-b6e3-023e7b805d55\" :question/id #uuid \"2ecdfaa1-5bd9-5f81-b6e3-023e7b805d55\"] [\"2ecdfaa1-5bd9-5f81-b6e3-023e7b805d55\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 4 \\\\cos{\\\\left(4 x + 1 \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"2ecdfaa1-5bd9-5f81-b6e3-023e7b805d55\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x + 1$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=4.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 4 \\\\cos{\\\\left(4 x + 1 \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sin{\\\\left(4 x + 1 \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"2ecdfaa1-5bd9-5f81-b6e3-023e7b805d55\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"2ecdfaa1-5bd9-5f81-b6e3-023e7b805d55\" :question/answer-fields \"58cda100-a260-5e8e-be68-fde68d9e9f1e\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"2ecdfaa1-5bd9-5f81-b6e3-023e7b805d55\"] [\"228461a2-75b4-5f54-8f71-89933be5be66\" :answer/id #uuid \"228461a2-75b4-5f54-8f71-89933be5be66\"] [\"228461a2-75b4-5f54-8f71-89933be5be66\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"228461a2-75b4-5f54-8f71-89933be5be66\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{3 \\\\cos{\\\\left(2 x + 1 \\\\right)}}{2}\"] [\"9fb08089-1bd7-5116-9851-4fa4e676b4dc\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"9fb08089-1bd7-5116-9851-4fa4e676b4dc\"] [\"9fb08089-1bd7-5116-9851-4fa4e676b4dc\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"9fb08089-1bd7-5116-9851-4fa4e676b4dc\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"9fb08089-1bd7-5116-9851-4fa4e676b4dc\" :answer-field/choices \"228461a2-75b4-5f54-8f71-89933be5be66\"] [\"9fb08089-1bd7-5116-9851-4fa4e676b4dc\" :answer-field/correct \"228461a2-75b4-5f54-8f71-89933be5be66\"] [\"364c4cf3-af52-5e60-b60f-daba0a790be0\" :question/id #uuid \"364c4cf3-af52-5e60-b60f-daba0a790be0\"] [\"364c4cf3-af52-5e60-b60f-daba0a790be0\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 3 \\\\sin{\\\\left(2 x + 1 \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"364c4cf3-af52-5e60-b60f-daba0a790be0\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x + 1$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 3 \\\\sin{\\\\left(2 x + 1 \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=- \\\\frac{3 \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{2}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\frac{3 \\\\cos{\\\\left(2 x + 1 \\\\right)}}{2}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"364c4cf3-af52-5e60-b60f-daba0a790be0\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"364c4cf3-af52-5e60-b60f-daba0a790be0\" :question/answer-fields \"9fb08089-1bd7-5116-9851-4fa4e676b4dc\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"364c4cf3-af52-5e60-b60f-daba0a790be0\"] [\"b8772597-72e4-58b4-b2a1-6f679b96ed8f\" :answer/id #uuid \"b8772597-72e4-58b4-b2a1-6f679b96ed8f\"] [\"b8772597-72e4-58b4-b2a1-6f679b96ed8f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"b8772597-72e4-58b4-b2a1-6f679b96ed8f\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{2}{3}\"] [\"dcd96290-8241-5bb2-b355-d84f90a808e0\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"dcd96290-8241-5bb2-b355-d84f90a808e0\"] [\"dcd96290-8241-5bb2-b355-d84f90a808e0\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"dcd96290-8241-5bb2-b355-d84f90a808e0\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"dcd96290-8241-5bb2-b355-d84f90a808e0\" :answer-field/choices \"b8772597-72e4-58b4-b2a1-6f679b96ed8f\"] [\"dcd96290-8241-5bb2-b355-d84f90a808e0\" :answer-field/correct \"b8772597-72e4-58b4-b2a1-6f679b96ed8f\"] [\"25bced4a-34ed-5c44-b898-2a6f8e96effe\" :question/id #uuid \"25bced4a-34ed-5c44-b898-2a6f8e96effe\"] [\"25bced4a-34ed-5c44-b898-2a6f8e96effe\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}} 2 \\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\sin{\\\\left(\\\\pi \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\sin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}=-1$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"25bced4a-34ed-5c44-b898-2a6f8e96effe\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=3.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\pi\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}} 2 \\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\pi}^{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}} \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[\\\\frac{2 \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{3}\\\\right]_{\\\\pi}^{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}}=\\\\left(- \\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\frac{2}{3}.\\n$$\"] [\"25bced4a-34ed-5c44-b898-2a6f8e96effe\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"25bced4a-34ed-5c44-b898-2a6f8e96effe\" :question/answer-fields \"dcd96290-8241-5bb2-b355-d84f90a808e0\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"25bced4a-34ed-5c44-b898-2a6f8e96effe\"] [\"021af31d-9874-5ae8-a272-4821d0e63678\" :answer/id #uuid \"021af31d-9874-5ae8-a272-4821d0e63678\"] [\"021af31d-9874-5ae8-a272-4821d0e63678\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"021af31d-9874-5ae8-a272-4821d0e63678\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{4}{3}\"] [\"30b9da8d-548f-5899-b955-bc31acebc31c\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"30b9da8d-548f-5899-b955-bc31acebc31c\"] [\"30b9da8d-548f-5899-b955-bc31acebc31c\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"30b9da8d-548f-5899-b955-bc31acebc31c\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"30b9da8d-548f-5899-b955-bc31acebc31c\" :answer-field/choices \"021af31d-9874-5ae8-a272-4821d0e63678\"] [\"30b9da8d-548f-5899-b955-bc31acebc31c\" :answer-field/correct \"021af31d-9874-5ae8-a272-4821d0e63678\"] [\"50022ab1-a0ca-57a9-87be-133525d6d898\" :question/id #uuid \"50022ab1-a0ca-57a9-87be-133525d6d898\"] [\"50022ab1-a0ca-57a9-87be-133525d6d898\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{\\\\frac{2 \\\\pi}{3}} 4 \\\\sin{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\cos{\\\\left(\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\cos{\\\\left(2 \\\\pi \\\\right)}=1$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"50022ab1-a0ca-57a9-87be-133525d6d898\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=3.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{2 \\\\pi}{3}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=2 \\\\pi\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{\\\\frac{2 \\\\pi}{3}} 4 \\\\sin{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}}^{2 \\\\pi} \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[- \\\\frac{4 \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{3}\\\\right]_{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}}^{2 \\\\pi}=\\\\left(- \\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\frac{4}{3}.\\n$$\"] [\"50022ab1-a0ca-57a9-87be-133525d6d898\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"50022ab1-a0ca-57a9-87be-133525d6d898\" :question/answer-fields \"30b9da8d-548f-5899-b955-bc31acebc31c\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"50022ab1-a0ca-57a9-87be-133525d6d898\"] [\"3b2130aa-7e91-5e77-ad7e-0a4dadbf02b7\" :answer/id #uuid \"3b2130aa-7e91-5e77-ad7e-0a4dadbf02b7\"] [\"3b2130aa-7e91-5e77-ad7e-0a4dadbf02b7\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"3b2130aa-7e91-5e77-ad7e-0a4dadbf02b7\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\sin{\\\\left(3 x + 2 \\\\right)}}{3}\"] [\"aba90ca0-400c-5f66-bb8d-ad32c6b1fcb8\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"aba90ca0-400c-5f66-bb8d-ad32c6b1fcb8\"] [\"aba90ca0-400c-5f66-bb8d-ad32c6b1fcb8\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"aba90ca0-400c-5f66-bb8d-ad32c6b1fcb8\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"aba90ca0-400c-5f66-bb8d-ad32c6b1fcb8\" :answer-field/choices \"3b2130aa-7e91-5e77-ad7e-0a4dadbf02b7\"] [\"aba90ca0-400c-5f66-bb8d-ad32c6b1fcb8\" :answer-field/correct \"3b2130aa-7e91-5e77-ad7e-0a4dadbf02b7\"] [\"6ea83d61-8ef7-5554-9089-4e7d6658d120\" :question/id #uuid \"6ea83d61-8ef7-5554-9089-4e7d6658d120\"] [\"6ea83d61-8ef7-5554-9089-4e7d6658d120\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x + 2 \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"6ea83d61-8ef7-5554-9089-4e7d6658d120\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x + 2$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=3.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(3 x + 2 \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{\\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{3}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\sin{\\\\left(3 x + 2 \\\\right)}}{3}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"6ea83d61-8ef7-5554-9089-4e7d6658d120\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"6ea83d61-8ef7-5554-9089-4e7d6658d120\" :question/answer-fields \"aba90ca0-400c-5f66-bb8d-ad32c6b1fcb8\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"6ea83d61-8ef7-5554-9089-4e7d6658d120\"] [\"74c24471-9d9e-52c9-9422-32e366c0f2a9\" :answer/id #uuid \"74c24471-9d9e-52c9-9422-32e366c0f2a9\"] [\"74c24471-9d9e-52c9-9422-32e366c0f2a9\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"74c24471-9d9e-52c9-9422-32e366c0f2a9\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{4}{3}\"] [\"334999f2-0ee1-5d2c-a8b2-9f1cd538e034\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"334999f2-0ee1-5d2c-a8b2-9f1cd538e034\"] [\"334999f2-0ee1-5d2c-a8b2-9f1cd538e034\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"334999f2-0ee1-5d2c-a8b2-9f1cd538e034\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"334999f2-0ee1-5d2c-a8b2-9f1cd538e034\" :answer-field/choices \"74c24471-9d9e-52c9-9422-32e366c0f2a9\"] [\"334999f2-0ee1-5d2c-a8b2-9f1cd538e034\" :answer-field/correct \"74c24471-9d9e-52c9-9422-32e366c0f2a9\"] [\"cce7215f-f09f-5bb0-8216-21c5515d0db7\" :question/id #uuid \"cce7215f-f09f-5bb0-8216-21c5515d0db7\"] [\"cce7215f-f09f-5bb0-8216-21c5515d0db7\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}} 4 \\\\sin{\\\\left(- 3 x + 2 \\\\pi \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\cos{\\\\left(2 \\\\pi \\\\right)}=1,\\\\quad \\\\cos{\\\\left(\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}=0$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"cce7215f-f09f-5bb0-8216-21c5515d0db7\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=- 3 x + 2 \\\\pi$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=-3.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=2 \\\\pi\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}} 4 \\\\sin{\\\\left(- 3 x + 2 \\\\pi \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=- \\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{2 \\\\pi}^{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}} \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[\\\\frac{4 \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{3}\\\\right]_{2 \\\\pi}^{\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{2}}=\\\\left(0\\\\right)-\\\\left(\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\frac{4}{3}.\\n$$\"] [\"cce7215f-f09f-5bb0-8216-21c5515d0db7\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"cce7215f-f09f-5bb0-8216-21c5515d0db7\" :question/answer-fields \"334999f2-0ee1-5d2c-a8b2-9f1cd538e034\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"cce7215f-f09f-5bb0-8216-21c5515d0db7\"] [\"2bd2ef87-461c-54e9-9cd4-436889993594\" :answer/id #uuid \"2bd2ef87-461c-54e9-9cd4-436889993594\"] [\"2bd2ef87-461c-54e9-9cd4-436889993594\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"2bd2ef87-461c-54e9-9cd4-436889993594\" :answer/value \"- \\\\sin{\\\\left(1 - 4 x \\\\right)}\"] [\"7662edc2-84aa-5b07-a675-80237a70e872\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"7662edc2-84aa-5b07-a675-80237a70e872\"] [\"7662edc2-84aa-5b07-a675-80237a70e872\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"7662edc2-84aa-5b07-a675-80237a70e872\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"7662edc2-84aa-5b07-a675-80237a70e872\" :answer-field/choices \"2bd2ef87-461c-54e9-9cd4-436889993594\"] [\"7662edc2-84aa-5b07-a675-80237a70e872\" :answer-field/correct \"2bd2ef87-461c-54e9-9cd4-436889993594\"] [\"04ed37b0-08bb-53bf-b3a9-2a83ea7f67cd\" :question/id #uuid \"04ed37b0-08bb-53bf-b3a9-2a83ea7f67cd\"] [\"04ed37b0-08bb-53bf-b3a9-2a83ea7f67cd\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 4 \\\\cos{\\\\left(1 - 4 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"04ed37b0-08bb-53bf-b3a9-2a83ea7f67cd\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=1 - 4 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=-4.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 4 \\\\cos{\\\\left(1 - 4 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=-\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n-\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=- \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\sin{\\\\left(1 - 4 x \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"04ed37b0-08bb-53bf-b3a9-2a83ea7f67cd\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"04ed37b0-08bb-53bf-b3a9-2a83ea7f67cd\" :question/answer-fields \"7662edc2-84aa-5b07-a675-80237a70e872\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"04ed37b0-08bb-53bf-b3a9-2a83ea7f67cd\"] [\"6ae91d07-3efa-5396-90bc-0c41330a98d6\" :answer/id #uuid \"6ae91d07-3efa-5396-90bc-0c41330a98d6\"] [\"6ae91d07-3efa-5396-90bc-0c41330a98d6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"6ae91d07-3efa-5396-90bc-0c41330a98d6\" :answer/value \"\\\\cos{\\\\left(2 - 3 x \\\\right)}\"] [\"80e6fd79-df4f-5e2f-b1d0-c8b8ac7c8d51\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"80e6fd79-df4f-5e2f-b1d0-c8b8ac7c8d51\"] [\"80e6fd79-df4f-5e2f-b1d0-c8b8ac7c8d51\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"80e6fd79-df4f-5e2f-b1d0-c8b8ac7c8d51\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"80e6fd79-df4f-5e2f-b1d0-c8b8ac7c8d51\" :answer-field/choices \"6ae91d07-3efa-5396-90bc-0c41330a98d6\"] [\"80e6fd79-df4f-5e2f-b1d0-c8b8ac7c8d51\" :answer-field/correct \"6ae91d07-3efa-5396-90bc-0c41330a98d6\"] [\"7c02193f-338d-5ea4-8f7d-c922830d530c\" :question/id #uuid \"7c02193f-338d-5ea4-8f7d-c922830d530c\"] [\"7c02193f-338d-5ea4-8f7d-c922830d530c\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 3 \\\\sin{\\\\left(2 - 3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"7c02193f-338d-5ea4-8f7d-c922830d530c\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 - 3 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=-3.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 3 \\\\sin{\\\\left(2 - 3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=-\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n-\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\cos{\\\\left(2 - 3 x \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"7c02193f-338d-5ea4-8f7d-c922830d530c\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"7c02193f-338d-5ea4-8f7d-c922830d530c\" :question/answer-fields \"80e6fd79-df4f-5e2f-b1d0-c8b8ac7c8d51\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"7c02193f-338d-5ea4-8f7d-c922830d530c\"] [\"a51af6db-9344-5ef0-81f9-25a39a63aa6f\" :answer/id #uuid \"a51af6db-9344-5ef0-81f9-25a39a63aa6f\"] [\"a51af6db-9344-5ef0-81f9-25a39a63aa6f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"a51af6db-9344-5ef0-81f9-25a39a63aa6f\" :answer/value \"1\"] [\"aec93d34-d853-521e-9b50-c9c26acbc741\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"aec93d34-d853-521e-9b50-c9c26acbc741\"] [\"aec93d34-d853-521e-9b50-c9c26acbc741\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"aec93d34-d853-521e-9b50-c9c26acbc741\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"aec93d34-d853-521e-9b50-c9c26acbc741\" :answer-field/choices \"a51af6db-9344-5ef0-81f9-25a39a63aa6f\"] [\"aec93d34-d853-521e-9b50-c9c26acbc741\" :answer-field/correct \"a51af6db-9344-5ef0-81f9-25a39a63aa6f\"] [\"14a4bdf4-8ea4-51a6-81da-5304f43e7279\" :question/id #uuid \"14a4bdf4-8ea4-51a6-81da-5304f43e7279\"] [\"14a4bdf4-8ea4-51a6-81da-5304f43e7279\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}} 4 \\\\cos{\\\\left(- 4 x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\sin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}=1,\\\\quad \\\\sin{\\\\left(0 \\\\right)}=0$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"14a4bdf4-8ea4-51a6-81da-5304f43e7279\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=- 4 x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=-4.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}} 4 \\\\cos{\\\\left(- 4 x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=-\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{0} \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[- \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{0}=\\\\left(0\\\\right)-\\\\left(-1\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n1.\\n$$\"] [\"14a4bdf4-8ea4-51a6-81da-5304f43e7279\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"14a4bdf4-8ea4-51a6-81da-5304f43e7279\" :question/answer-fields \"aec93d34-d853-521e-9b50-c9c26acbc741\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"14a4bdf4-8ea4-51a6-81da-5304f43e7279\"] [\"5d59fc83-7aa0-595d-aed1-8be7cb662f5e\" :answer/id #uuid \"5d59fc83-7aa0-595d-aed1-8be7cb662f5e\"] [\"5d59fc83-7aa0-595d-aed1-8be7cb662f5e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"5d59fc83-7aa0-595d-aed1-8be7cb662f5e\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\"] [\"7f4984fe-084f-51a5-bb0d-e7dc322c9849\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"7f4984fe-084f-51a5-bb0d-e7dc322c9849\"] [\"7f4984fe-084f-51a5-bb0d-e7dc322c9849\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"7f4984fe-084f-51a5-bb0d-e7dc322c9849\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"7f4984fe-084f-51a5-bb0d-e7dc322c9849\" :answer-field/choices \"5d59fc83-7aa0-595d-aed1-8be7cb662f5e\"] [\"7f4984fe-084f-51a5-bb0d-e7dc322c9849\" :answer-field/correct \"5d59fc83-7aa0-595d-aed1-8be7cb662f5e\"] [\"ee47bd77-b3fc-5c96-b3c1-1120ca3a9273\" :question/id #uuid \"ee47bd77-b3fc-5c96-b3c1-1120ca3a9273\"] [\"ee47bd77-b3fc-5c96-b3c1-1120ca3a9273\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}} \\\\sin{\\\\left(\\\\pi - 4 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\cos{\\\\left(\\\\pi \\\\right)}=-1,\\\\quad \\\\cos{\\\\left(0 \\\\right)}=1$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"ee47bd77-b3fc-5c96-b3c1-1120ca3a9273\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\pi - 4 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=-4.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\pi\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}} \\\\sin{\\\\left(\\\\pi - 4 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=- \\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\pi}^{0} \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[\\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{4}\\\\right]_{\\\\pi}^{0}=\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\right)-\\\\left(- \\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{2}.\\n$$\"] [\"ee47bd77-b3fc-5c96-b3c1-1120ca3a9273\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"ee47bd77-b3fc-5c96-b3c1-1120ca3a9273\" :question/answer-fields \"7f4984fe-084f-51a5-bb0d-e7dc322c9849\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"ee47bd77-b3fc-5c96-b3c1-1120ca3a9273\"] [\"a8bb3a90-6824-5d37-96be-dd04dbd40003\" :answer/id #uuid \"a8bb3a90-6824-5d37-96be-dd04dbd40003\"] [\"a8bb3a90-6824-5d37-96be-dd04dbd40003\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"a8bb3a90-6824-5d37-96be-dd04dbd40003\" :answer/value \"- \\\\sin{\\\\left(1 - 2 x \\\\right)}\"] [\"44f876a5-6b10-5536-9bb9-84048b43931d\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"44f876a5-6b10-5536-9bb9-84048b43931d\"] [\"44f876a5-6b10-5536-9bb9-84048b43931d\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"44f876a5-6b10-5536-9bb9-84048b43931d\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"44f876a5-6b10-5536-9bb9-84048b43931d\" :answer-field/choices \"a8bb3a90-6824-5d37-96be-dd04dbd40003\"] [\"44f876a5-6b10-5536-9bb9-84048b43931d\" :answer-field/correct \"a8bb3a90-6824-5d37-96be-dd04dbd40003\"] [\"e7ec123b-4f1a-58be-a8aa-4b6e169ef8a2\" :question/id #uuid \"e7ec123b-4f1a-58be-a8aa-4b6e169ef8a2\"] [\"e7ec123b-4f1a-58be-a8aa-4b6e169ef8a2\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2 \\\\cos{\\\\left(1 - 2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"e7ec123b-4f1a-58be-a8aa-4b6e169ef8a2\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=1 - 2 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=-2.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 2 \\\\cos{\\\\left(1 - 2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=-\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n-\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=- \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\sin{\\\\left(1 - 2 x \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"e7ec123b-4f1a-58be-a8aa-4b6e169ef8a2\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"e7ec123b-4f1a-58be-a8aa-4b6e169ef8a2\" :question/answer-fields \"44f876a5-6b10-5536-9bb9-84048b43931d\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"e7ec123b-4f1a-58be-a8aa-4b6e169ef8a2\"] [\"ed235227-92e6-56ef-94ee-f6721a92bb14\" :answer/id #uuid \"ed235227-92e6-56ef-94ee-f6721a92bb14\"] [\"ed235227-92e6-56ef-94ee-f6721a92bb14\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"ed235227-92e6-56ef-94ee-f6721a92bb14\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(1 - 4 x \\\\right)}}{2}\"] [\"1489bae4-46a0-523b-b1c4-f0b373879a4a\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"1489bae4-46a0-523b-b1c4-f0b373879a4a\"] [\"1489bae4-46a0-523b-b1c4-f0b373879a4a\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"1489bae4-46a0-523b-b1c4-f0b373879a4a\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"1489bae4-46a0-523b-b1c4-f0b373879a4a\" :answer-field/choices \"ed235227-92e6-56ef-94ee-f6721a92bb14\"] [\"1489bae4-46a0-523b-b1c4-f0b373879a4a\" :answer-field/correct \"ed235227-92e6-56ef-94ee-f6721a92bb14\"] [\"63ce9196-ff60-526d-af55-9fa94c804e8c\" :question/id #uuid \"63ce9196-ff60-526d-af55-9fa94c804e8c\"] [\"63ce9196-ff60-526d-af55-9fa94c804e8c\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2 \\\\sin{\\\\left(1 - 4 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"63ce9196-ff60-526d-af55-9fa94c804e8c\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=1 - 4 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=-4.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 2 \\\\sin{\\\\left(1 - 4 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{2}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\cos{\\\\left(1 - 4 x \\\\right)}}{2}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"63ce9196-ff60-526d-af55-9fa94c804e8c\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"63ce9196-ff60-526d-af55-9fa94c804e8c\" :question/answer-fields \"1489bae4-46a0-523b-b1c4-f0b373879a4a\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"63ce9196-ff60-526d-af55-9fa94c804e8c\"] [\"7d0f4e21-6b1a-544d-9189-ecf9b2f0cc03\" :answer/id #uuid \"7d0f4e21-6b1a-544d-9189-ecf9b2f0cc03\"] [\"7d0f4e21-6b1a-544d-9189-ecf9b2f0cc03\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"7d0f4e21-6b1a-544d-9189-ecf9b2f0cc03\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{1}{3}\"] [\"559a1b3d-66d6-54fa-b0b3-ca7a3aa0bb64\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"559a1b3d-66d6-54fa-b0b3-ca7a3aa0bb64\"] [\"559a1b3d-66d6-54fa-b0b3-ca7a3aa0bb64\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"559a1b3d-66d6-54fa-b0b3-ca7a3aa0bb64\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"559a1b3d-66d6-54fa-b0b3-ca7a3aa0bb64\" :answer-field/choices \"7d0f4e21-6b1a-544d-9189-ecf9b2f0cc03\"] [\"559a1b3d-66d6-54fa-b0b3-ca7a3aa0bb64\" :answer-field/correct \"7d0f4e21-6b1a-544d-9189-ecf9b2f0cc03\"] [\"9891ad60-b02c-519b-bb3b-3ccdc5f192ce\" :question/id #uuid \"9891ad60-b02c-519b-bb3b-3ccdc5f192ce\"] [\"9891ad60-b02c-519b-bb3b-3ccdc5f192ce\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}} \\\\cos{\\\\left(\\\\pi - 3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\sin{\\\\left(\\\\pi \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\sin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}=1$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"9891ad60-b02c-519b-bb3b-3ccdc5f192ce\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\pi - 3 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=-3.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\pi\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}} \\\\cos{\\\\left(\\\\pi - 3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=- \\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\pi}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}} \\\\cos{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[- \\\\frac{\\\\sin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{3}\\\\right]_{\\\\pi}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}=\\\\left(- \\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\frac{1}{3}.\\n$$\"] [\"9891ad60-b02c-519b-bb3b-3ccdc5f192ce\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"9891ad60-b02c-519b-bb3b-3ccdc5f192ce\" :question/answer-fields \"559a1b3d-66d6-54fa-b0b3-ca7a3aa0bb64\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions \"9891ad60-b02c-519b-bb3b-3ccdc5f192ce\"] [\"generator\" :question-generator/id #uuid \"9c56de7e-e192-530b-a1e1-58c6654e458d\"] [\"generator\" :question-generator/script \"generators/8c/8cc7eeae43792095e24c31a069aae8422965d29b422fbb787b8beebee0c7f513/generator.py\"] [17592186068915 :knowledge-point/question-generator \"generator\"]] \"retractions\" [[17592186068915 :knowledge-point/question-generator 17592186676316]]}",
